WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.069 --> 00:00:08.885
"Cora! The shark is coming!" Mo cried.

2
00:00:08.886 --> 00:00:13.976
The shark swung its big head.

3
00:00:13.977 --> 00:00:17.900
Cora charged at the hammerhead.

4
00:00:17.901 --> 00:00:24.450
Cora turned lots of different colors.

5
00:00:24.451 --> 00:00:27.636
She waved her eight arms all around.

6
00:00:27.637 --> 00:00:31.878
But nothing scared the shark.

7
00:00:31.879 --> 00:00:35.361
Then Cora sprayed her ink.

8
00:00:35.362 --> 00:00:38.536
A dark black cloud filled the water.

9
00:00:38.537 --> 00:00:43.311
The shark froze.

10
00:00:43.312 --> 00:00:47.614
"Yay! You stopped it!" Mo said.

11
00:00:47.615 --> 00:00:54.176
"No, I didn't," Cora said. "Here it comes!"

12
00:00:54.177 --> 00:00:56.503
"Uh-oh!" Mo cried.

13
00:00:56.504 --> 00:01:02.690
Suddenly— whoosh! Walt swam up to the

14
00:01:02.691 --> 00:01:06.751
shark. "Leave them alone!" he

15
00:01:06.752 --> 00:01:10.672
yelled. "Whoa!" The shark jumped back.

16
00:01:10.673 --> 00:01:14.218
"You're hungry, right?" Walt snapped.

17
00:01:14.219 --> 00:01:18.391
"Yes." The shark looked scared of Walt.

18
00:01:18.392 --> 00:01:23.369
"Then go hunt by the seagrass bed," Walt said.

19
00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:26.213
"There's plenty of food there."

20
00:01:26.214 --> 00:01:32.740
The shark didn't move.

21
00:01:32.741 --> 00:01:36.855
"Go!" Walt yelled. "Now!"

22
00:01:36.856 --> 00:01:39.018
The shark swam away!

23
00:01:39.019 --> 00:01:44.557
Walt spun around. "The shark's gone.

24
00:01:44.558 --> 00:01:50.478
Now you two—leave me alone!"

25
00:01:50.479 --> 00:01:54.493
He swam away.

26
00:01:54.494 --> 00:01:59.115
"Thank you, Walt!" Cora and Mo called.

27
00:01:59.116 --> 00:02:02.660
The arrow flew back to the cave.

28
00:02:02.661 --> 00:02:07.552
"Mo, let's find Rita," Cora said.

29
00:02:07.553 --> 00:02:19.680
"It's safe to come out and play now!"

